[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the front hub (1a) from the steering knuckle (1b) using\na hydraulic press (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044867.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>Position the wheel hub in a\nvice fitted with protective jaws.</p><p>1. Move the bearing inner race away from the front hug using a chisel\nto allow the extractor arms to be fitted.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>When carrying out this operation,\ntake the utmost care not to damage the front wheel hub.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044868.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the front wheel hub bearing inner race (1a) using the\ntools (1b), (1c) and (1d).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.854.005.003</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.854.005.002</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Pad</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.845.028.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044869.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Position the steering knuckle in a vice fitted with protective\njaws.</p><p>2. Remove the front hub bearing circlip.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044870.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the front hub bearing from the steering knuckle (1a) using\na hydraulic press (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044871.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Check that the internal surfaces\nof the front steering knuckle do not show signs of seizure and that\nthe arms have not suffered impact and do not show signs of breakage.\nIf they do, replace the steering knuckle.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Place a new front wheel hub bearing (1a) on the steering knuckle\nusing a hydraulic press (1b) and tool (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.875.055.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044872.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. If a hydraulic press is not available, fit a new front wheel\nhub bearing (1a) on the steering knuckle using the tools (1b) and\n(1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Grip</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.007.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.875.055.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044873.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>Refit the front wheel bearing\ncirclip in its seating.</p><p>1. Fit the front wheel hub in its housing on the steering knuckle\n(1a) using a hydraulic press (1b) and placing a suitable diamter\ncylinder (1c) in between.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044874.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]